The AVX2 GEGLU experiment evaluates erff polynomial coefficients and branch
formulas from libm 0.2.16's FreeBSD s_erff.c port. The original Sun Microsystems
permission notice is preserved in src/models/laya/cpu/x86_avx2/activation.rs. Other lanes
continue to use libm, without a new exponential approximation.

The optional AVX2 attention exponential adapts the expf.c / exp2f_data.c
algorithm and constants from Arm optimized-routines:
https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines
