The shared AVX2 exponential primitives in src/kernels/avx2_exp.rs adapt the same
Arm expf algorithm with FP64 intermediate arithmetic. Laya and Decima use the
nonpositive-input variant; Jev-Style and Kev use the full-domain exponential
through sigmoid. The file retains the MIT permission notice. Model-local
convolution layout, SIMD gating, and range handling are Rust modifications
validated independently against each model's scalar path.

Decima's SIMD128 GELU in src/models/decima/activation_wasm.rs and the common-range
attention exponential in src/models/decima/softmax_wasm.rs adapt the erf and
ReducedRangeExp algorithms from RTen 0.27.0, rten-vecmath/src/{erf,exp}.rs:
https://github.com/robertknight/rten
